# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E).
\[9\.20\].* ComputerScreenSecurity 
\[9\.20\].* text="Camera \|&1 : Temp Holding Cell"
\[9\.20\].* text="Door: Closed, Locked"
\[9\.20\].* text="Turret: Attacking Allies"
# A click on Door Status opens the door, and a click on Turret Status changes the targets of the turret.
\[10\.50\].* text="Door: Open, Locked"
\[12\.00\].* text="Turret: Attacking Enemies"
\[18\.20\].* text="Camera: Off"
